---
import ToolLayout from '../components/ToolLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="UUID Generator"
  description="Generate UUID v4 online"
  category="Dev Tools"
  keywords={["uuid", "guid", "generator"]}
>
  <div class="text-center">
    <Button size="lg" onclick="gen()">Generate UUID</Button>
    <div
      id="result"
      class="text-xl font-mono bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-700/30 rounded-xl p-5 mt-4 text-brand-400 min-h-[56px] select-all break-all"
    ></div>
    <button
      onclick="copyUUID()"
      class="text-xs bg-surface-800 text-surface-300 border border-surface-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-700 hover:text-white transition-colors mt-3"
    >Copy</button>
  </div>
<script is:inline>
function gen() {
  document.getElementById('result').textContent = crypto.randomUUID();
}
function copyUUID() {
  var el = document.getElementById('result');
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(el.textContent);
}
gen();
</script>
<div slot="info">
  <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-100 mb-2">What is a UUID Generator?</h2>
  <p class="mb-3">A UUID (Universally Unique Identifier) generator creates 128-bit identifiers that are practically guaranteed to be unique across all space and time. Version 4 UUIDs use random numbers, making them ideal for distributed systems where centralized ID assignment isn't possible.</p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-100 mb-2">When to Use</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-3 space-y-1">
    <li>Generating primary keys for database records in multi-server environments</li>
    <li>Creating unique filenames for user uploads to avoid naming collisions</li>
  </ul>
  <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-100 mb-2">How to Use</h2>
  <p class="mb-3">Click Generate to create a new random UUID v4. Each click produces a globally unique identifier.</p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-100 mb-2">Related Tools</h2>
  <p>Try our <a href="/random-string/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Random String Generator</a> for generating custom tokens and API keys.</p>
</div>
</ToolLayout>
